  "input_contract": "Actual RootedBinary N, CutChild, nonroot blob b, ActualBlobBigon A; original ordered registry H and strict probabilities p for their respective constructors. No source target, desired output law, weighted-tree identity, probability marginal, size bound or physical admission supplied as a new assumption.",
  "implemented_claims": [
    "retainedHybrid is the injective original-vertex projection; its image excludes exactly removedHybrid.",
    "splicedRegistry preserves original ordered parent0/parent1 occurrences through Sum.inl; it never chooses a canonical replacement order.",
    "splicedProbabilities pulls gamma back through retainedHybrid and inherits strict positivity/interiority.",
    "restrictBank is the full-bank pullback and commonSwitching_restrict proves its switching equals the actual G1 restrictSwitching."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "No rates, equal-exposure physical law, bank PMF marginal, protected-label trace, outer-admission transport or bounded certificate representative is proved by this module.",
    "Switching commutation is structural and therefore needs no arm-exposure equality; that is a later weighted-law hypothesis.",
    "Any future outer-admission wrapper must bind arbitrary A to the exact extracted splice, as described in0352.",
    "The existing connected1613, current319 and full1641 selections/configurations are unchanged."
  ],
